000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.  SPOMSTRM.
000500 AUTHOR.      KURT MOVSESIAN/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
000800
000900***************************************************************
001000*                                                             *
001100*D  S P O M S T R M                                           *
001200*                                                             *
001300*D  THIS SUB PROGRAM UPDATES ALL THE 'MSTORERM' DATA SET OF   *
001400*D  NECESSARY INFORMATION FOR A PO ITEM.  THE FIELDS UPDATED  *
001500*D  ARE - STR-MKT-COST, STR-REPAIR-COST, STR-LAST-PO, AND     *
001600*D  STR-LAST-VENDOR.  IT ALSO RETURNS BACK PO QTY AND PRICE   *
001700*D  IN TERMS OF STOREROOM UNITS.                              *
001800***************************************************************
      *                                                             *
      *C  06/18/1996  CA YODER                                      *
      *C    RECOMPILED TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.         *
      *C                                                            *
      *C  06/20/1997  CA YODER                                      *
      *C    DO NOT UPDATE STOREROOM MARKET COST WHEN THE CODE IS    *
      *C    A FRANCHISED ITEM.  PRICE IS SET BY 832 PRICE CATALOG   *
      *C    UPDATES.                                                *
      *C                                                            *
      *C  03/29/1999  CA YODER                                      *
      *C    BY REQUEST OF LAWTON, DO NOT UPDATE MARKET COST IF      *
      *C    PO IS AN "IT" ORDER.                                    *
      *C                                                            *
      *C  04/13/1999  CA YODER                                      *
      *C   IF SPOMSTRM-STR-PRICE ISN'T NUMERIC, MOVE 0 TO THE       *
      *C   FIELD TO AVOID A BLOWUP OF THE PROGRAM.                  *
      *C                                                            *
      *C  04/13/1999  CA YODER   NAPANEE REQUEST                    *
      *C   IF REPAIR ORDER, UPDATE STR-MKT-COST WITH UNIT VALUE.    *
      *C                                                            *
      *C  03/01/2000  CA YODER   NAPANEE REQUEST  (D. STUBBS)       *
      *C   CHANGED LOGIC TO NO LONGER UPDATE MARKET COST WITH UNIT  *
      *C   VALUE FROM A REPAIR ORDER.                               *
      *C                                                            *
      *C  11/2/00     JE COFFMAN                                    *
      *C   REMOVED VALLEYFIELD ONLY LOGIC FOR CALCULATING AVERAGE   *
      *C   COST SINCE THEY ARE EXECUTING CSAS AND THE AVERAGE       *
      *C   COSTS SHOULD BE GETTING UPDATED FROM THAT SYSTEM.        *
      *C   PROBLEM WAS NOT UNCOVERED UNTIL NOW AS WE DID NOT        *
      *C   KNOW THIS LOGIC EVEN EXISTED UNTIL CALLED TO MY          *
      *C   ATTENTION BY ANDRE BENJAMIN AND ANDRE GADBOIS.           *
      ***************************************************************
002000 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002100 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002200 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002300 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MSTORERM-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

002400
002500 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MSTORERM-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MSTORERM-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS0201.

002600
002700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".
002800 77  PREV-STR-TOT-VALUE           PIC S9(11)V9(4) VALUE ZEROS.
002900 77  PO-TOT-VALUE                 PIC S9(11)V9(4) VALUE ZEROS.
003000 77  TOT-VALUE                    PIC S9(11)V9(4) VALUE ZEROS.
003100 77  TOT-UNITS                    PIC S9(8)       VALUE ZEROS.
003200
003300
003400**************************************************************
003500**************************************************************
003600**                                                          **
003700**                DATABASE I/O BUFFER AREA                  **
003800**                                                          **
003900**************************************************************
004000**************************************************************
004100
004200 COPY MSTORERM   IN COPYLIB.
004300
